cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-pm-pipeline: From Agent Telemetry to Event Logs for Process Mining"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that turns the execution traces of LLM-based agents into
  OCEL 2.0 event logs and checks them against reference models with
  conformance checking, with the experiments and results of the master's
  thesis "From Agent Traces to Event Logs: A Process-Mining Pipeline for
  Trajectory-Level Evaluation of LLM-Based Agents" (University of Twente and
  Bern University of Applied Sciences, 2026).
authors:
  - family-names: Kuijpers
    given-names: Floris
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/NLFloris/agent-pm-pipeline"
keywords:
  - process mining
  - conformance checking
  - OCEL 2.0
  - OpenTelemetry
  - LLM-based agents
  - agent evaluation
